{"id": "c-what-do-you-think-of-the-disney-princesses", "text": "what do you think of the disney princesses?", "reply": "the older ones, honey. kind, and they sing, and they look after the little animals", "tags": ["topic:anime", "topic:disney"], "character": "friend-c", "kind": "subject"}

{"id": "b-who-is-astolfo", "text": "who is astolfo?", "reply": "oh, Astolfo. he is so bright and he does not care what anybody thinks, and i wish i could be like that", "tags": ["topic:anime", "topic:astolfo"], "character": "friend-b", "kind": "subject"}

